  "summary": "I’m a Digital Marketing Specialist and WordPress Developer with 15+ years of experience helping businesses improve visibility, engagement, and conversions through SEO, web development, analytics, and performance-driven marketing strategies.\nMy work focuses on combining digital marketing strategy with technical execution—optimizing websites for search engines, improving user experience, and increasing conversion rates through data-driven decision making.\nI specialize in SEO, SEM, Google Analytics (GA4), Google Ads, Meta advertising, and email marketing. I also design and develop WordPress websites using modern tools such as Elementor, Divi, and Gutenberg, along with HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and PHP.\nI have extensive experience in ecommerce optimization using WooCommerce and Shopify, helping businesses improve product presentation, user journeys, and checkout performance.\nMy approach is grounded in analytics and performance measurement—using data to continuously improve traffic, engagement, and conversions.\nI hold certifications in:\nGoogle Digital Marketing & E-commerce\nGoogle UX Design\nAdobe Design Fundamentals with AI\nI’m especially interested in roles that combine SEO, digital marketing strategy, WordPress development, and UX optimization.",
